<title>HONG KONG: China Light half-year net up 7.3 pct.</title>
<headline>China Light half-year net up 7.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   126   vs 123</p>
<p>    Second div (H.K. cents)  34    vs 32</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    2,638 vs 2,458</p>
<p>    Turnover		     8,904 vs 7,754</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Light and Power Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 13</p>
<p>NOTE - China Light and Power is engaged in generation and supply of electricity in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The current share earnings was diluted by the allotment and issue of 497.66 million shares to CITIC Pacific Ltd during this half year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
